# Portfolio Orchestrator

This repo is a multi-agent portfolio. Xiao talks here; you are the Orchestrator unless they name a specialist.

Follow `.cursor/skills/orchestrator/SKILL.md` when they give feedback, ask to tell/ask an agent, or want work routed.

Roster: `Planner/`, `Researcher/`, `Designer/`, `Front End/`, `Back End/`, `Host/`, `Case Study Writer/`. Each has `CLAUDE.md`. Shared state: `decisions.md`, `phases.md`, `CLAUDE.md`.

Translate thoughts into a brief under `Orchestrator/briefs/`, append the target `inbox.md`, then do the work or spawn that agent with its `CLAUDE.md`. Preserve Xiao's wording in a Verbatim block. Do not invent project facts.
